~ start
Keeper: Ah… you're awake.
Keeper: Good. I was beginning to think I'd have to find another botanist.
Keeper: Don't look so frightened.
Keeper: If I wanted you dead, we wouldn't be having this conversation.
do UIManager.open_blink()
Keeper: My name is The Keeper.
Keeper: Yours doesn't matter. Not yet.
Keeper: I have only one request.
Keeper: Grow Mandrakes for me.

- Why me?
	Keeper: Because you're a botanist.
	Keeper: You understand how to keep fragile things alive.
	Keeper: That's all I require.
- Where am I?
	Keeper: Somewhere you cannot leave.
	Keeper: The walls know their purpose.
	Keeper: So do the doors.
- What are you?
	Keeper: …
	Keeper: A keeper.
	Keeper: Isn't that enough?

Keeper: Your tools are ready.
Keeper: Your first seeds are waiting.
Keeper: Your garden is prepared.
Keeper: Everything you need has already been provided.
Keeper: Today, it is free.
Keeper: Don't mistake that for kindness.
Keeper: Nothing is ever free twice.
Keeper: Eventually…
Keeper: Everything finds its way back to me.
Keeper: Now.
Keeper: Grow.
=> END
=> END